Subject: [PATCH v2 33/35] lib/crypto: aesgcm: Use new AES library API
Date: Mon, 12 Jan 2026 11:20:31 -0800
Message-ID: <20260112192035.10427-34-ebiggers@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.52.0
